  "details": "Something that I think could be pretty useful, especially in time of issues would be if your menu could follow you.\n\nOne of the main situations I imagine this would be useful in is if you are falling through a world, if you open up your menu it'll stay up in the air and leave you behind. Now most worlds thankfully have a relatively short respawn height but for the one's that don't you'll be falling much longer than need be if you could access your menu even while moving.\n\nPossibly by having the menu situated in real space around you.",
